  === KILL CRITERIA ===

  Kill the mission if ANY of:
  1. Conviction-PnL correlation < 0.05 (conviction doesn't predict profit)
  2. Best conviction config underperforms random shuffle on Calmar
  3. Seed sensitivity does NOT improve (still >12%)
  4. Conviction ranking causes one strategy to dominate all capital (>80% fills)
  5. MaxDD worsens by >2pp on any portfolio configuration

  === EXCLUDED DIRECTIONS ===

