  - Multi-bet Kelly with full correlation matrix (too complex for first iteration)
  - Changing the underlying strategy signals (that's a per-strategy mission)
  - Dynamic weight allocation (separate mission: .strategy-mission-dynamic-weights)
  - Modifying exit logic (that was the profit-taking mission, now closed)

